body:
Should this check if the `built_in_future` isn't null before declaring success? `_create_spatial_context()` can return null for a couple of reasons.

Something like (untested):

```suggestion
	built_in_future = _create_spatial_context(p_marker_types);
	if (built_in_future.is_null()) {
		builtin_tracking_state = OpenXRSpatialEntityExtension::TrackingState::SETUP_FAILED;
		return false;
	}
```

